    "body": "Hi, I have the same issue with starship on windows 11 command prompt - simply clicking enter takes 0.5-1s.\r\n\r\nThis is not as severe as taking 4s but considering the same config between cmd/powershell/bash - only the cmd version with starship has this delay. And to rule out clink I've tried running cmd with oh-my-posh instead and that worked fine.\r\n\r\n`starship timings` don't show anything out of place:\r\n```\r\n❯ starship timings\r\n\r\n Here are the timings of modules in your prompt (>=1ms or output):\r\n battery     -   8ms  -   \"\"\r\n username    -   1ms  -   \"\"\r\n directory   -  <1ms  -   \"~\\Code \"\r\n line_break  -  <1ms  -   \"\\n\"\r\n character   -  <1ms  -   \"❯ \"\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere's a full output:\r\n[startship_cmd_timings.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17807704/startship_cmd_timings.log)\r\n\r\n",
